"66:3:22","transliteration":{"text":"qālat"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"مَنْ","location":"66:3:23","transliteration":{"text":"man"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"أَنۢبَأَكَ","location":"66:3:24","transliteration":{"text":"anba-aka"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا ۖ","location":"66:3:25","transliteration":{"text":"hādhā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"قَالَ","location":"66:3:26","transliteration":{"text":"qāla"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"نَبَّأَنِىَ","location":"66:3:27","transliteration":{"text":"nabba-aniya"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَلِيمُ","location":"66:3:28","transliteration":{"text":"l-ʿalīmu"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلْخَبِيرُ","location":"66:3:29","transliteration":{"text":"l-khabīru"}},{"char_type_name":"end","text_uthmani":"٣","location":"66:3:30","transliteration":{"text":null}}],"translation":"Peygamber, eşlerinden birine gizlice bir söz söylemişti. O, bunu Peygamberin diğer bir eşine haber verince, Allah da Peygambere durumu bildirmiş, o da bir kısmını yüzüne vurmuş bir kısmını yüzüne vurmaktan geri durmuştu. Eşine, gizlice söylediği şeyibaşkasına nakletmiş olduğunu bildirince, eşi: \"Bunu sana kim haber verdi?\" demiş, o da: \"Bana, herşeyi bilen ve herşeyden haberdar olan Allah haber verdi\" demişti.","transliteration":"wa-idh asarra l-nabiyu ilā baʿḍi azwājihi ḥadīthan falammā nabba-at bihi wa-aẓharahu l-lahu ʿalayhi ʿarrafa baʿḍahu wa-aʿraḍa ʿan baʿḍin falammā nabba-ahā bihi qālat man anba-aka hādhā qāla nabba-aniya l-ʿalīmu l-khabīru"},{"id":5233,"verse_key":"66:4","verse_number":4,"words":[{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"إِن","location":"66:4:1","transliteration":{"text":"in"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"تَتُوبَآ","location":"66:4:2","transliteration":{"text":"tatūbā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"إِلَى","location":"66:4:3","transliteration":{"text":"ilā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","location":"66:4:4","transliteration":{"text":"l-lahi"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"فَقَدْ","location":"66:4:5","transliteration":{"text":"faqad"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"صَغَتْ","location":"66:4:6","transliteration":{"text":"ṣaghat"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"قُلُوبُكُمَا ۖ","location":"66:4:7","transliteration":{"text":"qulūbukumā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَإِن","location":"66:4:8","transliteration":{"text":"wa-in"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"تَظَـٰهَرَا","location":"66:4:9","transliteration":{"text":"taẓāharā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","location":"66:4:10","transliteration":{"text":"ʿalayhi"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّ","location":"66:4:11","transliteration":{"text":"fa-inna"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","location":"66:4:12","transliteration":{"text":"l-laha"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"هُوَ","location":"66:4:13","transliteration":{"text":"huwa"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"مَوْلَىٰهُ","location":"66:4:14","transliteration":{"text":"mawlāhu"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَجِبْرِيلُ","location":"66:4:15","transliteration":{"text":"wajib'rīlu"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَصَـٰلِحُ","location":"66:4:16","transliteration":{"text":"waṣāliḥu"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ ۖ","location":"66:4:17","transliteration":{"text":"l-mu'minīna"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","location":"66:4:18","transliteration":{"text":"wal-malāikatu"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"بَعْدَ","location":"66:4:19","transliteration":{"text":"baʿda"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","location":"66:4:20","transliteration":{"text":"dhālika"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ظَهِيرٌ","location":"66:4:21","transliteration":{"text":"ẓahīrun"}},{"char_type_name":"end","text_uthmani":"٤","location":"66:4:22","transliteration":{"text":null}}],"translation":"Ey Peygamber'in eşleri! Eğer ikiniz de Allah'a tevbe ederseniz, kaymış olan kalpleriniz düzelmiş olur. Eğer eşinizin aleyhinde yardımlaşarak bir şey yapmağa kalkarsanız, bilin ki Allah onun dostu, bundan başka Cebrail, iyi müminler ve melekler de yardımcısıdır.","transliteration":"in tatūbā ilā l-lahi faqad ṣaghat qulūbukumā wa-in taẓāharā ʿalayhi fa-inna l-laha huwa mawlāhu wajib'rīlu waṣāliḥu l-mu'minīna wal-malāikatu baʿda dhālika ẓahīrun"},{"id":5234,"verse_key":"66:5","verse_number":5,"words":[{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"عَسَىٰ","location":"66:5:1","transliteration":{"text":"ʿasā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"رَبُّهُۥٓ","location":"66:5:2","transliteration":{"text":"rabbuhu"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"إِن","location":"66:5:3","transliteration":{"text":"in"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"طَلَّقَكُنَّ","location":"66:5:4","transliteration":{"text":"ṭallaqakunna"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"أَن","location":"66:5:5","transliteration":{"text":"an"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"يُبْدِلَهُۥٓ","location":"66:5:6","transliteration":{"text":"yub'dilahu"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"أَزْوَٰجًا","location":"66:5:7","transliteration":{"text":"azwājan"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"خَيْرًۭا","location":"66:5:8","transliteration":{"text":"khayran"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"مِّنكُنَّ","location":"66:5:9","transliteration":{"text":"minkunna"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"مُسْلِمَـٰتٍۢ","location":"66:5:10","transliteration":{"text":"mus'limātin"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"مُّؤْمِنَـٰتٍۢ","location":"66:5:11","transliteration":{"text":"mu'minātin"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"قَـٰنِتَـٰتٍۢ","location":"66:5:12","transliteration":{"text":"qānitātin"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"تَـٰٓئِبَـٰتٍ","location":"66:5:13","transliteration":{"text":"tāibātin"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"عَـٰبِدَٰتٍۢ","location":"66:5:14","transliteration":{"text":"ʿābidātin"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"سَـٰٓئِحَـٰتٍۢ","location":"66:5:15","transliteration":{"text":"sāiḥātin"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ثَيِّبَـٰتٍۢ","location":"66:5:16","transliteration":{"text":"thayyibātin"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَأَبْكَارًۭا","location":"66:5:17","transliteration":{"text":"wa-abkāran"}},{"char_type_name":"end","text_uthmani":"٥","location":"66:5:18","transliteration":{"text":null}}],"translation":"Ey Peygamber'in eşleri! Eğer o sizi boşarsa, Rabbi ona; sizden daha iyi olan, kendini Allah'a veren, inanan, boyun eğen, tevbe eden, kulluk eden, oruç tutan, dul ve bakire eşler verebilir.","transliteration":"ʿasā rabbuhu in ṭallaqakunna an yub'dilahu azwājan khayran minkunna mus'limātin mu'minātin qānitātin tāibātin ʿābidātin sāiḥātin thayyibātin wa-abkāran"},{"id":5235,"verse_key":"66:6","verse_number":6,"words":[{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","location":"66:6:1","transliteration":{"text":"yāayyuhā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","location":"66:6:2","transliteration":{"text":"alladhīna"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","location":"66:6:3","transliteration":{"text":"āmanū"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"قُوٓا۟","location":"66:6:4","transliteration":{"text":"qū"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"أَنفُسَكُمْ","location":"66:6:5","transliteration":{"text":"anfusakum"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَأَهْلِيكُمْ","location":"66:6:6","transliteration":{"text":"wa-ahlīkum"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"نَارًۭا","location":"66:6:7","transliteration":{"text":"nāran"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَقُودُهَا","location":"66:6:8","transliteration":{"text":"waqūduhā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسُ","location":"66:6:9","transliteration":{"te