location":"66:8:40","transliteration":{"text":"lanā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"إِنَّكَ","location":"66:8:41","transliteration":{"text":"innaka"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","location":"66:8:42","transliteration":{"text":"ʿalā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","location":"66:8:43","transliteration":{"text":"kulli"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","location":"66:8:44","transliteration":{"text":"shayin"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"قَدِيرٌۭ","location":"66:8:45","transliteration":{"text":"qadīrun"}},{"char_type_name":"end","text_uthmani":"٨","location":"66:8:46","transliteration":{"text":null}}],"translation":"Ey inananlar! Yürekten tevbe ederek Allah'a dönün ki, Rabbiniz kötülüklerinizi örtsün, sizi, içlerinden ırmaklar akan cennetlere koysun. Allah'ın Peygamberini ve onunla beraber olan müminleri utandırmayacağı o gün, ışıkları önlerinde ve defterleri sağlarından verilmiş olarak yürürler ve: \"Rabbimiz! Işığımızı tamamla, bizi bağışla, doğrusu Sen herşeye Kadir'sin\" derler.","transliteration":"yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū tūbū ilā l-lahi tawbatan naṣūḥan ʿasā rabbukum an yukaffira ʿankum sayyiātikum wayud'khilakum jannātin tajrī min taḥtihā l-anhāru yawma lā yukh'zī l-lahu l-nabiya wa-alladhīna āmanū maʿahu nūruhum yasʿā bayna aydīhim wabi-aymānihim yaqūlūna rabbanā atmim lanā nūranā wa-igh'fir lanā innaka ʿalā kulli shayin qadīrun"},{"id":5238,"verse_key":"66:9","verse_number":9,"words":[{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","location":"66:9:1","transliteration":{"text":"yāayyuhā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّبِىُّ","location":"66:9:2","transliteration":{"text":"l-nabiyu"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"جَـٰهِدِ","location":"66:9:3","transliteration":{"text":"jāhidi"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلْكُفَّارَ","location":"66:9:4","transliteration":{"text":"l-kufāra"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمُنَـٰفِق