"مَعَ","location":"66:10:26","transliteration":{"text":"maʿa"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلدَّٰخِلِينَ","location":"66:10:27","transliteration":{"text":"l-dākhilīna"}},{"char_type_name":"end","text_uthmani":"١٠","location":"66:10:28","transliteration":{"text":null}}],"translation":"Allah, inkar edenlere, Nuh'un karısıyla Lut'un karısını misal gösterir: Onlar, kullarımızdan iki iyi kulun nikahı altında iken onlara karşı hainlik edip inkarlarını gizlemişlerdi de iki peygamber Allah'tan gelen azabı onlardan savamamışlardı. O iki kadına: \"Cehenneme girenlerle beraber siz de girin\" dendi.","transliteration":"ḍaraba l-lahu mathalan lilladhīna kafarū im'ra-ata nūḥin wa-im'ra-ata lūṭin kānatā taḥta ʿabdayni min ʿibādinā ṣāliḥayni fakhānatāhumā falam yugh'niyā ʿanhumā mina l-lahi shayan waqīla ud'khulā l-nāra maʿa l-dākhilīna"},{"id":5240,"verse_key":"66:11","verse_number":11,"words":[{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَضَرَبَ","location":"66:11:1","transliteration":{"text":"waḍaraba"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","location":"66:11:2","transliteration":{"text":"l-lahu"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"مَثَلًۭا","location":"66:11:3","transliteration":{"text":"mathalan"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"لِّلَّذِينَ","location":"66:11:4","transliteration":{"text":"lilladhīna"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","location":"66:11:5","transliteration":{"text":"āmanū"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱمْرَأَتَ","location":"66:11:6","transliteration":{"text":"im'ra-ata"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"فِرْعَوْنَ","location":"66:11:7","transliteration":{"text":"fir'ʿawna"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"إِذْ","location":"66:11:8","transliteration":{"text":"idh"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"قَالَتْ","location":"66:11:9","transliteration":{"text":"qālat"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"رَبِّ","location":"66:11:10","transliteration":{"text":"rabbi"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱبْنِ","location":"66:11:11","transliteration":{"text":"ib'ni"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"لِى","location":"66:11:12","transliteration":{"text":"lī"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"عِندَكَ","location":"66:11:13","transliteration":{"text":"ʿindaka"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"بَيْتًۭا","location":"66:11:14","transliteration":{"text":"baytan"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"فِى","location":"66:11:15","transliteration":{"text":"fī"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَنَّةِ","location":"66:11:16","transliteration":{"text":"l-janati"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَنَجِّنِى","location":"66:11:17","transliteration":{"text":"wanajjinī"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"مِن","location":"66:11:18","transliteration":{"text":"min"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"فِرْعَوْنَ","location":"66:11:19","transliteration":{"text":"fir'ʿawna"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَعَمَلِهِۦ","location":"66:11:20","transliteration":{"text":"waʿamalihi"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَنَجِّنِى","location":"66:11:21","transliteration":{"text":"wanajjinī"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"مِنَ","location":"66:11:22","transliteration":{"text":"mina"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْمِ","location":"66:11:23","transliteration":{"text":"l-qawmi"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","location":"66:11:24","transliteration":{"text":"l-ẓālimīna"}},{"char_type_name":"end","text_uthmani":"١١","location":"66:11:25","transliteration":{"text":null}}],"translation":"Allah, inanlara Firavun'un karısını misal gösterir: O: \"Rabbim! Katından bana cennette bir ev yap; beni Firavun'dan ve onun işlediklerinden kurtar; beni zalim milletten kurtar\" demişti.","transliteration":"waḍaraba l-lahu mathalan lilladhīna āmanū im'ra-ata fir'ʿawna idh qālat rabbi ib'ni lī ʿindaka baytan fī l-janati wanajjinī min fi